out
*.tgz

# NOTE: dist/ is intentionally NOT ignored and IS committed. This package
# isn't published to npm -- README instructs `bun add github:4cecoder/ui-kit`,
# a git-based install with no build step, so the compiled output must already
# be in the repo for consumers to get anything usable.

